BOSS Scorchion Fire Orbs Loop
    Events
        Time - Every 2.20 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        (BossScorchion is alive) Equal to True
    Actions
        Game - Display to (All players) the text: debug: Fire Orbs Ca...
        -------- =================================== --------
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionPoint = (Position of BossScorchion)
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionTargetGroup = (Units within 700.00 of BossScorchionPoint matching ((((Matching unit) is alive) Equal to True) and (((Matching unit) belongs to an enemy of (Owner of BossScorchion).) Equal to True)).)
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionTarget = (Random unit from BossScorchionTargetGroup)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                BossScorchionTarget Not equal to No unit
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet BossScorchionTargetPoint = (Position of BossScorchionTarget)
                Set VariableSet BossScorchionAngle = (Angle from BossScorchionPoint to BossScorchionTargetPoint)
                Set VariableSet BossScorchionTargetPoint = (BossScorchionPoint offset by 150.00 towards BossScorchionAngle degrees.)
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Unit-type of BossScorchionTarget) Not equal to Totem
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Order BossScorchion to Special - Dark Summoning BossScorchionTargetPoint
                    Else - Actions
                -------- =================================== --------
            Else - Actions
        -------- =================================== --------
        Custom script:   call DestroyGroup(udg_BossScorchionTargetGroup)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossScorchionPoint)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossScorchionTargetPoint)
        -------- =================================== --------
